pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-08.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Pool with a raised wall of sheer descents, in-water loungers and an L-shaped sun shelf, pool renovation in Florida\"><img src=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-8/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-08.jpg\" alt=\"Pool with a raised wall of sheer descents, in-water loungers and an L-shaped sun shelf, pool renovation in Florida\" width=\"1250\" height=\"933\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-7/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-07.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Raised glass-tile spa and pool under a black pergola beside a two-story home, pool remodeling in Florida\"><img src=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-7/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-07.jpg\" alt=\"Raised glass-tile spa and pool under a black pergola beside a two-story home, pool remodeling in Florida\" width=\"1250\" height=\"933\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-6/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-06.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Pool with travertine coping beside a covered patio and palm trees, renovated pool in Florida\"><img src=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-6/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-06.jpg\" alt=\"Pool with travertine coping beside a covered patio and palm trees, renovated pool in Florida\" width=\"1250\" height=\"933\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-5/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-05.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Pool with a raised spa wall, glass-tile waterline and a shaded travertine deck, pool remodeling in Florida\"><img src=\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-5/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-05.jpg\" alt=\"Pool with a raised spa wall, glass-tile waterline and a shaded travertine deck, pool remodeling in Florida\" width=\"1250\" height=\"933\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button></div><script type=\"application/json\" class=\"mm-gal-mas\">[{\"url\":\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-4/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-04.jpg\",\"alt\":\"Long lap pool with a raised spa and a wide paver deck beside an open lawn, pool renovation in Florida\"},{\"url\":\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-3/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-03.jpg\",\"alt\":\"Pool with a sun shelf, two loungers and a raised white spa spilling into the water, pool remodeling in Florida\"},{\"url\":\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-2/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-02.jpg\",\"alt\":\"Aerial view of a pool with a mosaic spa, palms and a covered terrace, completed pool renovation in Florida\"},{\"url\":\"/images/images/pool-remodeling-1/custom-pool-remodeling-contractors-florida-01.jpg\",\"alt\":\"Rectangular pool with a raised mosaic spa, basketball hoop and travertine deck, pool remodeling in Florida\"}]</script></section><div><section class=\"mm-que\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><div class=\"mm-sec-tit\"><p class=\"mm-etiqueta\">What do we do!</p><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Pool Remodeling &amp; Full Renovation Services in Florida</h2></div><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">We remodel and renovate pools across North &amp; South Florida, upgrading finishes, equipment, and features for safety and efficiency.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Request a Design-Build Project Evaluation</a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-que-cuerpo\"><div class=\"mm-que-col\"><ol class=\"mm-grupos\"><li class=\"mm-grupo mm-grupo--activo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Shell &amp; Structural Restoration</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">A complete renovation starts below the surface. We assess the shell, plumbing and safety barrier first; where the structure needs it, the remodel rebuilds the gunite and brings plumbing and barriers up to current Florida Building Code. Every finish and fixture we install rides on that structure.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Complete Pool Renovation</dt><dd>Full pool renovations designed to modernize appearance, improve functionality, and extend the life of your pool.</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Structural Pool Repairs</dt><dd>Shell and structural work carried out as part of a complete renovation, when the assessment calls for it.</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Resurfacing, Tile &amp; Coping</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">We strip the old interior down to sound gunite and apply plaster, quartz, or pebble finishes rated for Florida sun and salt systems. We replace waterline tile and coping in the same pass, sealing the bond beam and leaving an edge that stays cool underfoot.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Pool Resurfacing &amp; Finishes</dt><dd>Pool resurfacing solutions including plaster, quartz, and pebble finishes for durability and style.</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Tile &amp; Coping Replacement</dt><dd>Tile and coping upgrades that enhance pool safety, aesthetics, and long-term structural protection.</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Equipment, Automation &amp; LED Lighting</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">Salt air and year-round run times are hard on pool equipment, so a complete remodel is the moment to replace it as one system: variable-speed pumps, filters, heaters and salt cells sized to the renovated pool, and low-voltage LED in place of incandescent fixtures. New wiring lands on GFCI-protected circuits bonded to the deck grid, as code requires.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Pool Equipment Upgrades</dt><dd>Pumps, filtration, heaters and automation replaced as one system within a complete remodel.</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>LED Pool Lighting Systems</dt><dd>Energy-efficient LED pool lighting designed to enhance visibility, ambiance, and nighttime safety.</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Pool Decks &amp; Spa Integration</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">A renovated pool beside a cracked, slick deck still looks tired. We resurface decks with textured, UV-stable coatings or pavers that stay walkable in South Florida heat, and we tie a new or remodeled spa into the pool so both share one plumbing and heating system.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Pool Deck Resurfacing</dt><dd>Pool deck resurfacing services that improve safety, appearance, and outdoor functionality.</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Spa Remodeling &amp; Integration</dt><dd>Spa remodeling and integration services that complement pool renovations for added comfort.</dd></div></dl></li></ol><div class=\"mm-datos\"><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+13527403361\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">North Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (352) 740-3361</span></a><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+19549137112\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">South Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (954) 913-7112</span></a></div></div><figure class=\"mm-lam-medio mm-que-medio\"><img class=\"mm-lam-foto\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-064/pool-shell-repair-spa-bond-beam-rebuild.avif\" alt=\"Spa with a newly poured concrete bond beam and exposed plumbing beside a drained pool, structural pool repair in Florida\" width=\"1200\" height=\"670\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div class=\"mm-lam-pie\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-n=\"01 / 04\" data-t=\"Shell &amp; Structural Restoration\"></div></figure></div></section><section class=\"before-after-section\"><div class=\"w-layout-blockcontainer container w-container\"><div class=\"before-after-content\"><div fb-before-after-start=\"50\" fb-before-after=\"true\" fb-before-after-direction=\"horizontal\" class=\"bas-wrapper\"><img alt=\"Before: screened pool 